        <CodeBlock 
          client:load
          language="bash"
          code={`# Estos comandos funcionan en Git Bash, PowerShell, Terminal (Mac/Linux)
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit: Portfolio completo"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/tu-usuario/mi-portfolio.git
git push -u origin main`}
        />

        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 mt-6">7.3 Deploy a Vercel (GRATIS)</h3>
        
