    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2>🔧 Troubleshooting (Problemas Comunes)</h2>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-red-500">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 mb-2">
            ❌ Error: "Cannot find module"
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm mb-2"><strong>Solución:</strong></p>
          <CodeBlock 
            client:load
            language="bash"
            code={`# Linux / macOS / Git Bash:
rm -rf node_modules package-lock.json
npm install

# Windows PowerShell:
Remove-Item -Recurse -Force node_modules, package-lock.json
npm install

# Windows CMD:
rmdir /s /q node_modules
del package-lock.json
npm install`}
          />
        </div>

        <div class="card border-l-4 border-yellow-500">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 mb-2">
            ⚠️ React Island no se hidrata
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm mb-2"><strong>Verificar:</strong></p>
          <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
            <li>Agregaste <code>client:*</code> directive? (client:load, client:visible, etc.)</li>
            <li>El componente está en <code>.tsx</code> no <code>.astro</code>?</li>
            <li>Exportaste con <code>export default</code>?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-l-4 border-blue-500">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-2">
            💡 Build funciona local pero falla en Vercel
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm mb-2"><strong>Chequear:</strong></p>
          <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
            <li>Node version en Vercel (Settings → Node.js Version → 18.x o superior)</li>
            <li>Variables de entorno si usas APIs</li>
            <li>Los imports son case-sensitive en producción</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

